== HW Interfaces
================================================================
* M_AXI
+----------------+------------+------------+---------------+---------+--------+----------+-----------+--------------+--------------+-------------+-------------+
| Interface      | Read/Write | Data Width | Address Width | Latency | Offset | Register | Max Widen | Max Read     | Max Write    | Num Read    | Num Write   |
|                |            | (SW->HW)   |               |         |        |          | Bitwidth  | Burst Length | Burst Length | Outstanding | Outstanding |
+----------------+------------+------------+---------------+---------+--------+----------+-----------+--------------+--------------+-------------+-------------+
| m_axi_att_out  | READ_WRITE | 8 -> 8     | 64            | 0       | slave  | 0        | 0         | 16           | 16           | 1           | 1           |
| m_axi_aux      | READ_ONLY  | 8 -> 8     | 64            | 0       | slave  | 0        | 0         | 16           | 16           | 1           | 16          |
| m_axi_fixture  | READ_ONLY  | 8 -> 8     | 64            | 0       | slave  | 0        | 0         | 16           | 16           | 1           | 16          |
| m_axi_io       | READ_WRITE | 8 -> 8     | 64            | 0       | slave  | 0        | 0         | 16           | 16           | 1           | 16          |
| m_axi_observed | WRITE_ONLY | 32 -> 32   | 64            | 0       | slave  | 0        | 0         | 16           | 16           | 16          | 1           |
| m_axi_qkv0     | READ_WRITE | 8 -> 8     | 64            | 0       | slave  | 0        | 0         | 16           | 16           | 1           | 1           |
| m_axi_qkv1     | READ_WRITE | 8 -> 8     | 64            | 0       | slave  | 0        | 0         | 16           | 16           | 1           | 1           |
+----------------+------------+------------+---------------+---------+--------+----------+-----------+--------------+--------------+-------------+-------------+

* S_AXILITE Interfaces
+-----------------+------------+---------------+--------+----------+
| Interface       | Data Width | Address Width | Offset | Register |
+-----------------+------------+---------------+--------+----------+
| s_axi_control   | 32         | 4             |        |          |
| s_axi_control_r | 32         | 7             | 16     | 0        |
+-----------------+------------+---------------+--------+----------+

* S_AXILITE Registers
+-----------------+--------------+--------+-------+--------+----------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
| Interface       | Register     | Offset | Width | Access | Description                      | Bit Fields                                                           |
+-----------------+--------------+--------+-------+--------+----------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
| s_axi_control   | CTRL         | 0x00   | 32    | RW     | Control signals                  | 0=AP_START 1=AP_DONE 2=AP_IDLE 3=AP_READY 7=AUTO_RESTART 9=INTERRUPT |
| s_axi_control   | GIER         | 0x04   | 32    | RW     | Global Interrupt Enable Register | 0=Enable                                                             |
| s_axi_control   | IP_IER       | 0x08   | 32    | RW     | IP Interrupt Enable Register     | 0=CHAN0_INT_EN 1=CHAN1_INT_EN                                        |
| s_axi_control   | IP_ISR       | 0x0c   | 32    | RW     | IP Interrupt Status Register     | 0=CHAN0_INT_ST 1=CHAN1_INT_ST                                        |
| s_axi_control_r | fixture_r_1  | 0x10   | 32    | W      | Data signal of fixture_r         |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control_r | fixture_r_2  | 0x14   | 32    | W      | Data signal of fixture_r         |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control_r | io_r_1       | 0x1c   | 32    | W      | Data signal of io_r              |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control_r | io_r_2       | 0x20   | 32    | W      | Data signal of io_r              |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control_r | aux_r_1      | 0x28   | 32    | W      | Data signal of aux_r             |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control_r | aux_r_2      | 0x2c   | 32    | W      | Data signal of aux_r             |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control_r | qkv0_r_1     | 0x34   | 32    | W      | Data signal of qkv0_r            |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control_r | qkv0_r_2     | 0x38   | 32    | W      | Data signal of qkv0_r            |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control_r | qkv1_r_1     | 0x40   | 32    | W      | Data signal of qkv1_r            |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control_r | qkv1_r_2     | 0x44   | 32    | W      | Data signal of qkv1_r            |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control_r | att_out_r_1  | 0x4c   | 32    | W      | Data signal of att_out_r         |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control_r | att_out_r_2  | 0x50   | 32    | W      | Data signal of att_out_r         |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control_r | observed_r_1 | 0x58   | 32    | W      | Data signal of observed_r        |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control_r | observed_r_2 | 0x5c   | 32    | W      | Data signal of observed_r        |                                                                      |
